## What’s working well

| Area | Notes |
|------|--------|
| **Visual identity** | The glowing green bud character with the lit tip and subtle smoke is distinctive and on-brand. |
| **Color system** | Dark backgrounds (`#0d0f12`, `#16191e`) + accent `#38d39f` feel modern and premium. |
| **Orbit metaphor** | Modules arranged around a central figure is a creative way to show “everything lives under one AI.” |
| **Chat-first framing** | Positioning the product as a conversational tool (strains, legal, designs) is clear once you understand it. |
| **Typography** | Inter is a solid, readable choice. |

